\newlabel{tab:encoders}{{2}{4}{The six encoders on one harness (corrected data, 3 origins $\times $ 3 seeds, squared error, no seasonal features). Mean validation / test RMSE. The pure SEIR decoder (\texttt {foi}) is worse than persistence on every encoder; the gated SEIR head (\texttt {foi\_res}) brings all six to within 0.25 of each other, below persistence.\relax }{table.caption.5}{}}
